# Phase 1 – Identity & Access Hardening

## Objectives
- Reduce risk of account takeover
- Limit blast radius of compromised credentials
- Improve auditability and control

## Key Actions
- Enforce MFA across cloud services
- Separate administrative and standard user accounts
- Restrict RDP access to required systems only
- Deploy a centralized password manager

## Success Criteria
- MFA enforced for all administrative accounts
- No daily-use accounts with administrative privileges
- Reduced RDP exposure
- Secure credential storage in place
